<title>USA: Dental Services names Paul Rothman Pres.</title>
<headline>Dental Services names Paul Rothman Pres.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dental Services of America Inc said Tuesday it elected Paul Rothman president.</p>
<p>He replaces Roger Prieto, who has accepted the position of vice president in charge of professional services, the company said.</p>
<p>Most recently, Rothman has served as a consultant to various managed care organizations, developing systems and strategic plans for those entities, the company said.</p>
